> =

> Now, what I get from my syslog :
> hda_codec: Unknown model for ALC861, trying auto-probe from BIOS...
> hda-intel: Invalid position buffer, using LPIB read method instead.
> =

> The first one came when loading the driver and doesn't disappear with
> any of the model I tried,

It's strange.  It must disappear if you pass a certain correct model
option.

Anyway, try to set disable_msi=3D1 module option.  This will turn off
MSI support.  It seems that MSI is broken on many machines, and we'll
disable it as default in future, until the kernel gets fixed.


